{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"笔记"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"strat-cat"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"分层空间与范畴"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><strong>命题</strong>. “"},{"Local":{"url":"出路范畴","text":"出路范畴"}},{"Plain":"” 函子\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{Exit}\\colon \\mathsf{Strat} \\to \\mathsf{Cat}\r\n$$\n为全忠实函子.</p>\n<p><strong>定理</strong>. 有范畴等价\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{Stri} \\simeq \\mathsf{Cat}.\r\n$$\n换言之,</p>\n"}]}}